flowchart TB
accTitle: AZ-700 learning and documentation map
accDescr: Read the five-domain book and objective matrix, then choose a main-root profile, an independent example, or a design exercise. Local validation is separate from future Azure evidence.
R["README<br/>Scope • safe starter • validation status"] --> B["Wiki book<br/>Five-domain curriculum"]
B --> D1["1 Core<br/>25–30%"]
B --> D2["2 Connectivity<br/>20–25%"]
B --> D3["3 Delivery<br/>15–20%"]
B --> D4["4 Private access<br/>10–15%"]
B --> D5["5 Security<br/>15–20%"]
D1 & D2 --> P["Main-root profiles<br/>minimal • vWAN • VPN • Route Server<br/>private DNS • delivery • legacy review"]
D3 & D4 & D5 --> E["Independent examples<br/>AVNM • Front Door • Traffic Manager<br/>Private Link service • endpoint policy • P2S • DDoS"]
P & E --> M["Objective matrix<br/>Terraform-backed • reference configuration • design exercise"]
M --> X["Design worksheets<br/>ExpressRoute • BYOIP • appliance • external VPN • Defender"]
M --> V["Local checks<br/>schema • mock assertions • links • diagrams"]
X & V --> N["Evidence boundary<br/>Azure deployment and live traffic: NOT RUN"]
